  "local_source_correction": "p. 275 first Steiner proof-display sum starts at j=0, not the printed j=1. An actual zero affine map on the unit line cube has quotient 2r>0 and zero printed degree-one coefficient. The whole lemma statement is unchanged. This proved correction is absent from the working erratum.",
